# Local database the drizzle folder is applied to: drizzle-kit/libSQL's
# `file:./data/db.sqlite` (drizzle.config.ts, lib/database/libsql.ts). Generated
# locally by `bun run db:migrate:d1`; D1 is the real database.
apps/debate-ai.com/data/
# Database migrations (apps/debate-ai.com/drizzle). NOTE: `db:migrate:d1`, which
# `npm run deploy` runs before every build, applies `drizzle/*.sql` to
# production D1 from this folder, and `drizzle/seed/videos-seed.sql` is read by
# `db:seed:videos:d1`. Ignoring it does not stop those scripts reading local
# files, but nothing in the repo will carry the migration history that rebuilds
# a D1 database from scratch. Re-track with:
#   git add -f apps/debate-ai.com/drizzle
apps/debate-ai.com/drizzle/

# debate-api-client: types generated from debate-openapi.yml (regenerate with `bun run generate`)
packages/debate-api-client/src/generated/
packages/debate-api-client/dist/

